  "interpretation": "The original UX change showed >10% regressions on this core microbenchmark. After the minimal hot-path fix, none of the three final paired throughput ratios in any workload was below 0.90; final ratios of medians range from 0.954 to 1.074. Shared-host variance is substantial, especially baseline history throughput, so these samples do not establish universal speedups or equality.",
